<title>SINGAPORE: Asian rice prices - March 6.</title>
<headline>Asian rice prices - March 6.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rice prices quoted on Thursday by trading and official sources in the key producing nations of Thailand, Vietnam and India in U.S. dollars a tonne:</p>
<p>							     March 6    Feb 27</p>
<p>Thailand-100 pct white B benchmark FOB Bangkok 355-385   355-385</p>
<p>Thailand-100 pct fragrant rice FOB Bangkok     685-690   650-670</p>
<p>India-5.0 pct broken(non-Basmati long grain) FOB 300	 295</p>
<p>India-10 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	280-285     285</p>
<p>India-15 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	250-255     250</p>
<p>India-25 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	235-240     235</p>
<p>Vietnam-5.0 percent broken FOB Saigon port     265-268   265-270</p>
<p>Vietnam-10 percent broken FOB Saigon port	258-261   255-260</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703305)</p>
</text>
